  "pandas.DataFrame.kurtosis": ["Use the same excess kurtosis calculation as kurt.", "DataFrame.kurtosis(*[, axis, skipna, ...])", null, "kurt နဲ့ တူတဲ့ excess kurtosis တွက်ချက်မှုကို သုံးပါတယ်။"],
